{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_st02","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-ST-2","storyName":"焦点","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"凶手不加掩饰的暴行闹得片场人心惶惶。格蕾塔以自己的经历告诉众人她的眼光值得信任，随后解散了剧组——所有人都能自行选择，她会跟想继续拍摄的人完成作品。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["工作人员A","工作人员B","摄影助理","阿布纳","斯蒂芬","米兰妮","工作人员C","格蕾塔","工作人员们"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_62_g3_filmset.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1847_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"喂喂，你也看到迈克尔和玛丽昂的尸体了，对吧？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"哎哟，我好不容易才把那个恐怖的景象从脑子里面赶出去，你怎么又说起来了！","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"我、我的手都在抖，感觉要握不住录音杆了……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"你怎么还想着工作！我们现在待着的地方真的有一个连环杀人魔！","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员B","text":"那我们赶紧逃吧？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1847_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"逃？你忘了迈克尔和玛丽昂是为什么被凶手盯上的吗？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"迈克尔的脚下还放着行李，听说他做了充足的准备，找到了私下开溜的路子……","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"但他还是在离开这个地块的前一刻被找上了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"那个凶手不会让任何人离开的。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员A","text":"就像《开膛黎博利杰克》一样，这里是他的猎场，我们每个人都可能是他的猎物。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"阿布纳，你多久没检查胸架了？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"看，升降臂这边的几个螺丝都已经松了，一个不小心，摄影机就得在地上砸个粉碎……","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"碎了就碎了。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"那我帮你保养下这几组镜头吧。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"不用。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我是你的助理，阿布纳。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"别以为我不知道你献殷勤是为了什么——滚远点，小子。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"道尔顿的死不是意外，对不对？还有谢莉、迈克尔和玛丽昂……","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"凶手不可能是无差别杀人，所有的受害者，都和五年前的那起意外有关。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"你该去当娱乐记者，而不是摄影助理。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#5$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"不矛盾啦，前者更好讨生活……阿布纳，我的好阿布纳，五年前你也在，反正现在有时间，你就跟我说说嘛！","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"米兰妮女士，这会儿没有您的戏……","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我难道能安心继续在房间里研究“杜邦夫人”死前的妆造？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"这关系到结尾那几场高潮戏，抱歉，我还没有……","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"啊，你的神迟到了。但我现在没有心情责怪你和你的神，亲爱的。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"发生了这么大的事，如果不是离主城区太远，蓝卡坞的警察这会儿已经封锁整个地块，项目也早已停工……","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"当然，现在的情况也没有好到哪儿去。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"斯蒂芬，我开始担心自己的投资要血本无归了。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这几天发生的事情，你知道多少隐情？格蕾塔知道多少？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员C","text":"斯蒂芬导演，米兰妮女士，原来二位也在啊。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":84},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.7","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员C","text":"制片人呢？格蕾塔应该给所有人一个说法！","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"窃窃私语。","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"到处都是窃窃私语的声音，整个摄影棚内，没有一个人在工作。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"三起命案、四个死者，接二连三的变故摧毁了这些人的状态，恐慌、愤怒、困惑、无所适从……整个剧组在失控的边缘。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"真吵啊，吵得人心里乱糟糟的。她讨厌这种感觉。","id":98},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"格蕾塔径直走向摄影棚的中央，她打开了最亮的那盏场灯，刺目的光亮逼停了每一个人的动作和话头，人们注意到了她。","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"格蕾塔深深呼吸。","id":113},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":114,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"各位，我要宣布一些事情。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我不是演员，台词功底没那么好，听不清的往我这边靠。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":118},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footsteps_flock","volume":"0.5","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"……","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"……","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"……","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员们","text":"……","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":127},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"几分钟后，各位可以查看自己在蓝卡坞的专属金融终端。来之前，我已经委托财务，付清了剧组每一位成员酬劳的尾款。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当然，道尔顿、谢莉、迈克尔、玛丽昂，除了为这几位朋友结算应得的酬劳之外，还会给他们的家属发放抚恤金，我事后会专门处理。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"是的，《杜邦夫人之死》的拍摄还没有结束，合同还有效力，我本不需要这么做——但毕竟，已经没几个人的心思还在工作上了。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"嘿，格蕾塔，这不像你。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"剧组只不过是出了一些……不算小的意外，还没到放弃的时候。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"还是说，经历这些事情之后，作为制片人，你已经对电影最后的质量不抱任何信心了。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"放弃？亲爱的，你想多了。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我从不怀疑自己的眼光，自然也谈不上会放弃。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"可是你现在……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":142},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我给大家讲个故事吧。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"喂，小子……","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"格蕾塔女士，您是在叫我？","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"拿出你的录音笔、笔记本、速记终端……随便什么，然后坐好，用心听。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"什、什么意思？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"别再让我看到你那些偷偷摸摸的小动作，我接下来说的所有事情，你都可以光明正大地记下来。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你也可以去找《特里蒙娱乐周刊》《蓝卡坞咖啡时间》《多面人物》……我个人不会以任何方式对你进行追责，只要你能把消息带出去。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"无论对你来说，出卖消息换取的是奖赏，还是，惩罚。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"“蓝卡坞学院奖”，想必在场的每一个人都熟悉。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"蓝卡坞面向新人的专业奖项，每年都有无数的影视学院学生、电影爱好者向它投去稿件，想尽办法证明自己多么懂创作多么懂市场。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"他们渴望作品能入选，因为哪怕只是拿到最末的奖项，也意味着自己得到了进入蓝卡坞的资格……有个斐迪亚也不例外。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"她自认眼光不凡，有想法也有毅力，自信哪怕暂时只能挤在出租屋里，也终会站在蓝卡坞发布会的红毯上。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"终于，她等来了最好的故事，找到了最好的搭档，她攒起团队，把那个故事拍了出来，寄了出去。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"可这个小地方来的家伙太渴望自己能成功了，更何况此刻身上还背负着所有同伴的信任……","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"评选结束的倒计时越近，她的渴望越深，对自己作品的怀疑反而越强烈。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#8$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"她说不清自己怎么就动了歪心思，她求遍亲友，凑了一笔巨款——对当时的她来说……然后，她敲开了那些评委的门。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"怎么听着这么熟悉……","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"“学院奖”揭晓的当天，组委会公开了斐迪亚的所作所为，向全泰拉的观众证明了蓝卡坞的专业与纯洁。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"而那个斐迪亚呢，她投稿的作品被取消评奖资格，团队的所有成员与她决裂，她失去了一切。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我想起来了！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"这件事超级讽刺！根据组委会后来披露的资料……那个作品本来已经拿到了最高票，是最受评委们瞩目的作品。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#7$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"后来，那个家伙用了十年的时间，穷尽一切办法才重回蓝卡坞，慢慢地，也做出了些成绩。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#9$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当然，她给自己改了名……格蕾塔·斯通。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"米兰妮，现在你明白了，我是个极其愚蠢的人。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……我主动向命运讨要了一个玩笑。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"好在，这段说来我自己都倍感荒唐的经历教会了我一件事——我不该怀疑自己。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我相信我自己的眼光，我不会放弃我想做的任何事情。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"哈哈，你比我想象中稍微有意思了那么一点。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"说实话，我一直以为你身上那股子自以为是的劲，是故意装出来唬人的。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"得了吧，格蕾塔。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"你突然搞这么一出，又说起这么个没头没尾的故事，不就是为了博取我们的同情……","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我们站的地方在死人，我们的前面有天灾……发生了这么多的事，你还想让我们继续为你卖命？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我知道你一直对我耿耿于怀，阿布纳。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……从五年前开始。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"那我可不敢。毕竟，我可是靠着那部电影里的经典镜头，拿到了当年蓝卡坞最佳摄影奖……","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"那可是一个电影摄影师能拿到的最高荣誉……你赏赐给我的！","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"可在那之后呢？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"明明达到了职业生涯的巅峰，却自暴自弃，短短半年后就没人敢再请你掌镜。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"曾经你那么疼爱自己手里的摄影机，如今却像对待空了的薯片袋子一样对待它们……","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"进《杜邦夫人之死》这个剧组之前，你甚至在赌场里输掉了跟了自己十几年的老伙计，对吧？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#7$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"……","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你憎恨五年前的那部电影，你憎恨那个让你获奖的画面，你憎恨当时让你把它保留下来的我——","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"没错！","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我的摄影机偶然拍下了那个叫劳拉的女孩从高空坠落的画面，我当时看到你的表情时就知道你没安什么好心……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我警告过你很多次，可你还是强行将那个画面剪进了电影里……","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"影评人们越是夸那个镜头多么真实多么震撼，我就越觉得可笑！","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"电影是造梦的艺术，摄影机是造梦的手和看梦的眼睛，你侮辱了那个女孩子，你侮辱了我！","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我讨厌我手里的这些机器，我讨厌我的工作，你明白吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"阿布纳，既然如此，放下它。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#3$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"你说什么？","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"很抱歉我们跑题了，让我们言归正传——","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"确认酬劳到账后，各位可以随时离开剧组。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"想要赶紧逃离这个危险重重的地块的，请自便；害怕连环杀人犯想要找个地方躲着的，请自便……","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"出于种种目的想要充当侦探的，请自便；甚至那个还不愿意放弃复仇的凶手，也请自便。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"《杜邦夫人之死》绝大多数的拍摄工作已经完成，只剩下最后这两天，只剩下最后几场高潮戏……","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"还愿意留下来的人，或许我们依然可以把它拍完。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"至于缺了摄影师……我会顶上阿布纳的位置。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#2$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"……","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"米兰妮？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"毕竟我没办法临时变出另一个“杜邦夫人”。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你知道的，我没有选择。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我还指望凭着这部电影打败玛丽安娜呢，格蕾塔。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"灾难，难道不是另一种形式的眷顾吗？","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"玛丽安娜已经息影多年了，真不知道你对她哪儿来这么大的执念。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这就不用你过问了。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但丑话说在前面，人都跑光之后，你在意的那些女主演的待遇、片场的规矩……可就顾不上了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"哈哈。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"斯蒂芬。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#2$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我知道我知道，我会今天晚上就把结局修改出来！","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我相信我拍下这个故事时的判断，亲爱的，这几天，你也已经思考够多积累够多了。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"天灾近在咫尺，死亡就在眼前……你的神难道不爱这些素材吗？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"……","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"感谢各位这段时间的付出，祝大家好运。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我想说的就是这些。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlightc","volume":"1","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":279},{"type":"image","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281}],"characters":["工作人员A","工作人员B","摄影助理","阿布纳","斯蒂芬","米兰妮","工作人员C","格蕾塔","工作人员们"]}